    "title": "Notre Dame Baseball wins 8-inning game over Poplar Bluff - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Todd Richards ,\n1 days ago CAPE GIRARDEAU, Mo. (KFVS) - The Notre Dame Baseball team beat Poplar Bluff 5-4 in 8 innings. Notre Dame star TJ Bolen provided the walk-off winner for the Bulldogs. Cape Girardeau Mayor-elect Robbie Guard threw out the first pitch, and the Bulldogs players wore throwback Cape Catholic Jerseys at home. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 2",
